# 2026-04-28: Added to stop Sequin's Docker image from rebuilding on every
# SST deploy. Root cause: SST regenerates `sst-env.d.ts` (and matching
# subpackage versions) inside this directory on every `sst deploy`. The
# files are tiny (~30 lines of TypeScript reference declarations) but they
# CHANGE on every deploy, so docker.Image v4's content-hash check sees the
# context as "changed" and rebuilds — burning ~4 minutes per ship.
#
# This .dockerignore excludes the regenerated files (Elixir doesn't need
# them anyway) plus the standard build/dev cruft that bloats the build
# context send.

# SST-generated TypeScript declarations — regenerated every deploy
**/sst-env.d.ts

# Standard build / dev artifacts not needed inside the container
**/node_modules
**/_build
**/deps
**/.elixir_ls
**/cover
**/erl_crash.dump
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitkeep
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/tmp

# Editor / IDE
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.aider*
**/CLAUDE.md
